{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_st01","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_st01","title":"唤醒噩梦","storyCode":"SV-ST-1","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_st01.txt","sourceHash":"c4b166b68fbe3203572a82094f37cb19caa534dcccedaee1a815fab4b89036c0","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"教堂下方的溶洞中，歌蕾蒂娅表明目的，却遭埋伏的海嗣重创。海嗣告知斯卡蒂关于深海猎人身世的最大秘密。她们的血脉被唤醒。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibchurch"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"快快，请进，请进。我知道你会来这里的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"该怎么解释呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。不用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你到哪里都会背着那个箱子吗，吟游歌手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"那你介意我再问个问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"这箱子里装的是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨克斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，真不错，萨克斯......吹奏乐器吗。不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我是否有幸听听它的音色？音乐......这座城市已经许多年没有音乐响起了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，不，抱歉......我忽然想到，吟游歌手要拿报酬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"这可难住我了，您看，恐怕我拿不出什么赏钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"且看这座老建筑。哼，打理它是件相当困难的事，货币在这里代表不了什么，没人收集，也没人用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"但我也有提供一顿午餐的余力。吟游歌手，怎么样？你愿不愿意随便演奏点什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"请你吃顿饱饭这种事我还算是能做到的，虽然也不是什么美味佳肴......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"看你沉默不语的样子......啊，会不会是这样：比起音乐，你更喜欢舞蹈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，你还穿着舞裙......有天赋的人。我们可太久没在这见到你这样光彩照人的朋友了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......肉麻。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你如果要听什么，当时你就可以让我唱。不用到这。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来是要问一个问题。你身边站着的这个人可能知道，现在我觉得你也脱不开干系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我的，这位——熟人，过去和你认识吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自然认识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"没有问你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂娅别过头去，不再言语。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不认识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我不知道这个人是不是我当初认识的那个了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"这个，也是正常的。人都是会变的。海水拍打陆地，假以时日也能让海岸变成沙子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你来这里，不是她让你来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——不是你让我来的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"仅仅是我让你来，你是不会来这里的，对吧。我只是个陌生人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是问，她有没有让你来这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有。我是自己来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你没有说谎。我能听出谎言......但你是诚实的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"问这问那，我却什么都还没说，你怎么能这么讨人厌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"消气，消气，歌手。我不是故意的。谨慎一点对我们都有好处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我来问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这座城市里的人很信任你，但是，在海岸上发生的那些事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绝对不正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乞食。恐鱼。海。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是哪里人？你是不是知道些什么？你和她对我隐瞒了什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，哈哈。是的，我知道的比别人确实要多一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"确实，我知道有人想见你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"见我？因为我是个吟游歌手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"在乎音乐的是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然这听上去有些荒唐，但想见你的其实不是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"想见你的是我的一位朋友。应他要求，我才邀请你来到这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁？他想见我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"随我来吧。见到他你就知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟......你也有一位朋友在这。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“你想见她，不是吗。”\n主教的语气轻描淡写，斯卡蒂却不能安之若素。\n这个猎人暗暗握紧箱子的把手。得益于材料学的进步以及罗德岛切实投入的大量经费，她才没把这个特制“萨克斯箱”的把手捏碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"请走这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"至于你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你也来。赏赐你的时候也到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂看了眼歌蕾蒂娅，没多说什么。\n斯卡蒂循着主教的身影走去。不知怎么的，她总感觉主教的走路姿势很怪，像是软了腿，或是缺了关节。\n三人拾级而下，教堂的墓穴下方赫然是个空洞，楼梯随着岩壁蜿蜒向下，一圈接着一圈，仿佛走入某种庞然大物的食道，没有光芒，道路全凭感觉摸索，随时都可能跌入深处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，我就不点灯了，不过这对你也没什么难度吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说吟游歌手大多数身手也不错，城市和荒野都不太友善，出远门的人很容易遭灾，一定得学一身保护自己的本事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"钱财买不到音乐，音乐却可以当货币，只要唱得一首好歌，到哪里都饿不死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前也很向往这种生活，可能因为我并不擅长这些吧......一旦在哪扎下根，我就很难再离开了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"主教一个人仿佛自言自语，因为另外两人在下行时从不说话。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcave"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我们到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们难道在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，在海底。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"随着楼梯不断深入，他们终于踏上平地。密不透风的潮湿甚至让斯卡蒂觉得呼吸困难，直到他们从黑暗走进那一缕光线，眼前的开阔景象才让猎人精神一振。\n巨大的溶洞中充斥着古怪的设备，透过海洋渗入洞窟的天光从隐秘的地方照亮了这里，淡淡的蓝色昭示着它的方位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"怎么会这样。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_07"},{"type":"narration","text":"幽灵鲨的身体漂浮在水缸之中，像是死了，又或者是睡熟了。\n多少想法在斯卡蒂脑中闪过。\n她为什么在这？是歌蕾蒂娅做的吗？如果幽灵鲨死了呢？歌蕾蒂娅怎么会允许幽灵鲨被杀？！难道她真的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她就是你的朋友，对吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是叫斯卡蒂吗？你的事不是我在跟。他们把你处理得很好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"尤其是你身边的人。他们处理得很好，让你的精神状态保持在这种感觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂睁大了双眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"最近他们没空管你，但拜你这位队长所赐，你到了这里，简直是送给我的礼物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂转头怒向歌蕾蒂娅，却发现背后无人。\n歌蕾蒂娅已经走向了主教，步伐轻盈得像是没有心事。她引以为豪的速度，深海猎人中盛传的速度......就像是这无声的一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然是你先走上前......而不是那个歌手。你在等什么？之前你为什么没有杀我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会有那么愚蠢吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这些孽物，从来都这个样子......自我感觉良好，又言之无物。这个试验品，她的生命在这里消失，也无所谓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确认过成果让你心安。你满意的神情溢于言表，却也不让我看你带她去了哪里。那么你还不能让她死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们几个里，她的生命一定是你最看重的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我毁掉了你们那么多试验场地——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"果真是你做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——幽灵鲨很宝贵。你对深海猎人实施源石感染性的测试，就只有这一个样本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"陆生牲畜的原罪能在你们这些孽物身上起效，不是很有趣吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂和歌蕾蒂娅的脸色都起了变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然......我们三人的试验场真的被你毁掉太多了。投入了如此大量的、精炼过的液化源石，用上了阿戈尔的技术......都不能再复现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"她确实很宝贵。我只是想不通她是如何能对抗如此规模的源石感染......她的脊髓，经过稀释，也够感染一个小国。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"现在不一样了，谢谢你把她送到我手里，孽物。我会领先另外两人......我会发现你们最后的秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我会证明自己的成就。我的研究。我们敌人的秘密。以及弱点......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会先死在这。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂暗暗用劲，她对歌蕾蒂娅的不解与恼火和她现在对主教的愤怒相比，根本不值一提。\n只要一下，就把这个始作俑者打碎成肉泥。\n就一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我留你一命，证明了你是那个人。不值得留着的我已经处决掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然证明了你和他们，和这个实验的牵连，那你也不用活下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深海教会......你是深海教会的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我允许你这么称呼我了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太能藏了。你们每个人都不一样。什么话都会说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幽灵鲨之所以会变得疯疯癫癫......也是因为你们的灌输和折磨吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面那些人，你利用了那些人。你也在把他们当试验品？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"投海的人......都成了你实验的牺牲品？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"放肆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"主教的身形似乎庞大了几分。他也许是真的发怒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"大海的施舍可不是什么利用。这是救济。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以放着他们不管，他们会死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"海洋给他们食物，给他们不愿活着的人自由活下去的新生......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂打了个寒颤。恐鱼。恐鱼。成为恐鱼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这些孽物又怎么能理解......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以了，主教。我表现出来关心你目的的态度了吗？如果你错会了，请你立刻忘记。你丑陋的行径涸墨难书，我只关心你的遗毒还能漂流多远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到这里就可以了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为你多带一个人......就可以稳胜我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你和你的同类一样自信——一样愚蠢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们有些人选择成为恐鱼这件事，我已经知道了。这恐怕不能成为底牌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使你能变成一只海嗣——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂忽然意识到，那个海嗣的气味近了。\n并且，那不是主教。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二队长！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_08"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂向前跃去，但那只海嗣已经离歌蕾蒂娅太近，太近。\n凭歌蕾蒂娅的速度，她能在声音传来之前躲开。\n但是，前提是，歌蕾蒂娅想躲。\n歌蕾蒂娅并没有意识到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗬，嗬嗬......（呛血的声音）......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Gla-dia。他的请求如此。我这么做了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"休息吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂目击了怪物刺穿歌蕾蒂娅的一瞬，又看着它抽出肢体，放任歌蕾蒂娅颓然倒落。\n陷阱。这是个陷阱。斯卡蒂早就做好准备去对抗海嗣......但歌蕾蒂娅为什么没意识到？\n是因为有自己在让她轻敌了？还是因为幽灵鲨的事情让她不再冷静？\n谁是猎人，谁是猎物？\n而且，海嗣——怎么会——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"（为什么......为什么，为什么？）\n为什么歌蕾蒂娅选择在这里动手？明明只要叫一声斯卡蒂，她们两人就能轻易杀死主教！\n这个主教真的不是怪物吗？自己闻到的气味一直是这只海嗣而不是主教吗？\n面前这个东西是什么？是恐鱼吗？主教的化形吗？海嗣吗？\n如果它是自己长久以来一直憎恨的敌人，为什么它会说话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla。我想见你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂不言语。她的手伸向箱子，观察着海嗣的第一个动作，第一个可能发生的动作。\n生死都只是一瞬间的事情。她要怪物死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"好多年的沉浮。好多年的游动。好多生死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"啐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"愚蠢的孽物。如果不是使者需要你，你们这些孽物早就死在滩头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"混蛋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"使者，早点解决这个问题吧。看着这些侵害我们海洋的人，我总觉得恶心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你这么想攻击她们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"她们这些东西，阿戈尔创造出来的杂种，杀了我们多少同胞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是——不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先问完这个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla，我的姐妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"姐妹，你现在也不清楚自己从哪里来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来自阿戈尔，怪物......我是你的天敌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"那就让我给你真相吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你们就是我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"什么？\n什么？\n不。\n不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你流着我们的血。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂想过很多次。斯卡蒂知道自己和它们有联系，但她把这一切都归结为是最后一战给她留下了伤疤。\n但她闻得见。她知道。她听得到。她认得出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"扯谎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"使者，你......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"Isha-mla。 你的血是我们的血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你们肉体在那，然后我们的血进去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"我有许多血亲。他们遇见你们。他们死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"他们闻见你们气味。就像你闻见我们气味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"他们以为同胞困在你们皮底。他们不顾危险撕咬你们皮肉，他们想从你们囊泡里把自己同胞释放。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"他们还没有准备好，他们那时还没有器官去了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你们没有在体内困住同胞。你们就是我们同胞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla。你就是我们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"海嗣的语言仿佛带有魔力。斯卡蒂纷乱的思绪回到过去，当她与其他猎人们一起斩杀恐鱼时，那些血腥越重，他们就越兴奋，他们的动作就越激烈，他们的身体在做出回应。\n对同类的血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"我会唤醒你。你会想起那种感觉。阿戈尔人的身体脆弱，事物过去太快。我会帮你找到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下。停下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"但你，想知道。我知道你想知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂想知道。\n斯卡蒂想知道自己究竟是什么，想知道为什么自己要遭遇这么多坏事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们杀害我们阿戈尔人......现在又想来和我沾亲带故？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"我的血与你的血相同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你闻到我们气味，正如我们闻见你气味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你们找到我们，杀死我们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不懂时，我们也杀死你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"我们喂养海洋。我们的尸体供养了海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla，我们拥有同个故乡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们杀了我的家人。是你们杀了我的妈妈，我的奶奶，我的妹妹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂想知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不去阿戈尔城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么多的城市都被你们毁了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"那些城市在我们领地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，即使在阿戈尔腹地的城市，也会有人被你们捕猎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不这么做。在城市死去无法供养族群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈尔人攻击我们，我们攻击阿戈尔人。没有区别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你们领地里的人的死，是你领地里的人做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说谎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"说谎？我想知道说谎的意思。“扯谎”，刚才你也说了。我想知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂僵住了。\n斯卡蒂仿佛触及了海嗣的思想。\n海嗣的信息直接从气味中流入了她的脑海。\n她能这么做。她......当然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla，你和我们间的阻隔太强。你没有办法把想法传给我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你能知道我们所想，这也够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"我的身体生长，能够说语言，能和你交流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"语言臃肿，不好使用，我只能这样说，但是这样你就能告诉我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla，我为见你而来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂知道。斯卡蒂从那种种中知道——\n海嗣不会说谎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你......不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你时常感觉，周围活物，与你陌生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你在游动时，能够感到海水方向，也能知道没有光的海里的各种事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你有些时候睡下，感到自己与大群同游。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂的血液已经沸腾。\n怎会如此？怎会......如此？\n斯卡蒂知晓。\n斯卡蒂感同身受。\n斯卡蒂与其他猎人窃窃私语。\n斯卡蒂与其他猎人都是怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你为什么要说。为什么要说？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"自己就是怪物。\n自己杀害同族。\n自己为同族杀害同族。\n自己被同族杀害同族。\n街道上的人眼神很暖。他们什么都不知道。\n研究所和营帐中的眼神都冷。\n猎人睡眠时有巡海者守卫。不。那不是守卫。那不是为猎人守夜。\n巡海者在等待猎人成为怪物。\n以及，她看见......她看见过......\n她的那个姐妹吃食阿戈尔人，它嚼着骨头，嘴角撕裂，直到队长他将它杀死为止。\n“她被恐鱼感染了神经，恐怕是某种恐鱼成了她身体的一部分，我们救不回她了。”\n不，不。\n那是因为，她已经不再把阿戈尔人当成同胞。她回到她家乡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你回忆起来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂沉浸在黑色的静海之中。\n她的逃跑与守卫都无意义。\n她的过往与未来都无意义。\n她是海怪。\n她是，一只，海怪。恐鱼。海嗣。\n除了她以外，谁都可能知道的。\n海怪。\n以及，她曾经犯下了最大的罪过......\n如果她是海怪，如果她的兄弟姐妹在此，那么她......\n她想起那东西毫无反抗。\n她想起那东西轻轻将触须叠在自己身上。\n我杀了它。\n我杀了她。\n我杀了祂。\n主教所想都得诠释，但主教身处混乱。他的自尊与蔑视交缠在一起，可他没法破解海嗣口中所出真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"......不可能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么......之前没有......为什么我们没能看出来？！我们为什么查不出？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂娅那贯通了她胸膛的伤口还在汩汩流出鲜血。但她的心脏却没有随之停止跳动......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla。 我有问题要问，Ishar-mla。抬起头来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂机械地抬起面孔，她看着面前自称是自己兄弟的生物，双眼茫然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我杀了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我杀了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我杀了它们的神。\n我杀了它们的生代。\n我杀了我们的生代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我杀了祂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祂什么都没做，而我......我却......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就连我的......我的妹妹......也是......阿戈尔人......阿戈尔人......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"都是阿戈尔人杀的。\n我的姐妹，我的妈妈，我的奶奶......\n原来我报复了那么多年，都是错的。\n这一切，竟然都是阿戈尔人杀的。深海教会。阿戈尔人。\n海嗣不说谎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"罪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的罪恶......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla，不要疑惑。我们没有罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是做了你会做的事，Ishar-mla，同胞做的没罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我替阿戈尔......我们杀了那么多......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"血腥味涌上喉头。\n是负疚感吗？并不是。\n斯卡蒂只是茫然。她忽然意识到，支持她这么多年，令她足以承担巨大痛苦的源动力......消失了。\n她所做的一切都是虚无的。\n为了整个阿戈尔？斯卡蒂可不把自己摆得那么高尚。给自己找理由不过是自我安慰。\n阿戈尔......阿戈尔又把他们深海猎人当做什么？\n自己究竟“是什么”？我到底活了个什么？这一切的一切，和那时奋不顾身的我，又哪里有关系了？\n“我——在做什么？”\n......\n海嗣不成熟的词句将她拉回现实，如果这种强烈的眩晕感和焦灼感算得上是“现实”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你认为自己是阿戈尔，那么你杀也对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你把其他人当做血亲，所以你那么做，我们不知道，我们攻击你们时候你那么做，也对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"——Ishar-mla。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈尔，无鳞，你们语言里才有“罪”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"为生存做，都是对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有错。所以你知道的都可说，我们没有愿意，只有说和不说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"我会问问题。说吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"终于还是问到这个问题。\n斯卡蒂不想说。但她流淌着海嗣的血......流淌着真相。\n阿戈尔会不知道自己的家人是遭到谁的杀害吗？\n如果真的有海嗣走进大城......真的只会是她们受害吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla。在你们的攻击下，我们失去了同它之间的联系，密切的联系。我们只能感受到它的搏动，没法听到它声音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你们最后一次同游，最后一次一起攻击，就是那时。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是的，自己很清楚，是的。\n最后只剩下她一个。\n撕碎怪群。打开天空。冲向黑暗。\n所有深海猎人倾巢而出。所有同僚的生命都在她脚底排放。所有战斗都为了那一瞬间。\n她拼死刺下的那一瞬间。\n海怪和猎人的血几令大洋腐烂，死亡沉淀到一个程度就没法再诞生新的生命。\n她看到......她看到祂沉下去。\n在那之前，她看到那只巨大的眼球正注视自己。她感到有什么连上了自己的意识，她的皮肤觉得很酸，她的视界震耳欲聋，她还闻到疼痛，她甚至都觉得自己已经疯了。\n但她很清醒。活着是清醒的。\n因为祂“开口”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"当它在你面前又一次沉眠时，你有没有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"听到它说话？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂的血液已经几乎要在她体内烧着。\n斯卡蒂知道答案。\n她知道。即使这个秘密她打算留到自己死去——\n但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祂——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祂说——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我们遭受的苦永在。\n斯卡蒂没来得及说出这话。\n斯卡蒂最后一点反抗心促使她不断眨眼。\n她瞥见歌蕾蒂娅从血泊中爬起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你？！使者！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。只能下次......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂娅知道刚才该躲开。歌蕾蒂娅是没去躲开。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac18_09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"（体液堵塞的声音）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"Gla-dia......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"（呜咽一样的声音）......你很健壮，Gla-dia。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"垃圾。（阿戈尔语）对你我不会有一丝礼貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿戈尔语）猎物就该乖乖......困在陷阱里惨叫。你才是猎物，垃圾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"长槊又一次滑动，一瞬间就在海嗣身体上切开了巨大的伤口，海嗣体液喷涌，腐蚀了歌蕾蒂娅的手臂......但她的伤口也一样很快愈合。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"姐妹......你信号的传递......密集。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情绪。恨。猎物怎么会懂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爱。恨。痛苦。悲伤。欢乐。欣慰。在你们看来都无用。你们觉得这是渣碎......是不必要的东西，是赘余，是不是?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没有你说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么你就更不会懂，垃圾。我们宁可身有赘余也要那样活下去。我们不是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"Gla-dia。情绪。真是很强的情绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你连歌都不会唱。死吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么——怎么会？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么她的身体能从那种伤害中恢复？？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂娅用力将长槊从海嗣身体里拔了出来，接着又跃向斯卡蒂身前，飘然落地。\n歌蕾蒂娅挣脱了，或者她知道，如果她不挣脱，海嗣就能在下一秒将她揉碎，无论它是否有此意愿。\n她将长槊猛地一横。即使这个海嗣不想，主教也一定想杀死斯卡蒂。而她，歌蕾蒂娅，一个深海猎人的队长，得保护自己的猎人。\n好吧，哪怕她不是自己大队的。\n她的脑海里飞快地过着各种想法，却没有一个在考虑自己的伤势。\n因为现在完全够用。这具身体现在的状况还是足够她去杀掉任何人。\n海嗣的身体正在痉挛，他复杂的肌肉支撑着身体。\n鲜血自歌蕾蒂娅伤口中不住涌出。斯卡蒂浑身血管凸起，她挣脱不了海嗣带给她的感知和庞大的神经信号。\n海洋幽深广大，它的儿女却自甘分饰猎人与猎物。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
